\subsection{Degraded operation}

When the triage service is unreachable or exceeds its timeout, the assessment is
recorded with the band marked unavailable, the breakdown absent, and a flag
indicating the model did not contribute. It is not inferred, not carried forward
from a previous reading, and not defaulted to \textsc{low}. The summary is still
produced, from the numbers, by the deterministic tier.
Fig.~\ref{fig:states} shows the two states and what they share.

