\subsection{Test suite}

The implementation carries 151 automated tests: 104 in Python covering NEWS2
boundary conditions at every threshold, the zero-noise generator identity,
patient-level split integrity, the inference API contract, and the clinical and
calibration metrics; and 47 in Java covering token handling, every combination
